    <section id="c__what_are_gsps">
      <title>What are Grayscale Pallettes?</title>
      <p id="c__what_are_gsps_p">
        A grayscale palette is a range of shades from black to white, featuring only variations in gray without any color hue. It contains only black, white, and gray. The gray has multiple levels to reflect differences in shade, depth, and shadows.
      </p>
